DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T153000
DURATION:PT3H
SUMMARY:Danvers Golf at Bishop Fenwick (W 172–166)
LOCATION:The Meadow at Peabody
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 172\, Bishop Fenwick 166\nBen Campbe
 ll put up 32 points and three teammates were right behind him as Danvers e
 dged Bishop Fenwick by six in a Stableford match.\nSchedule and results: h
 ttps://danversfalconsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
