UID:volleyball-3@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Gloucester (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Gloucester 0\nThe home opener wa
 s a sweep. The Falcons hit .267 as a team\, with seven kills from Gabriell
 e Lindeman\, six aces from Lauren Garofalo and 14 assists from Hannah Ters
 olo.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball
 /schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:football-1@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T183000
DURATION:PT2H30M
SUMMARY:Danvers Football vs Concord-Carlisle (W 16–0)
LOCATION:Morse Field at Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 16\, Concord-Carlisle 0\nThree Falco
 ns ran for 100-plus yards and the defense never let Concord-Carlisle run a
  play in Danvers territory. Danvers rolled up 382 yards\, 353 of them on t
 he ground\, and allowed no first downs and just 15 yards of offense in the
  season opener.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org
 /football/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
