SUMMARY:Danvers Boys Soccer at Masconomet (L 0–7)
LOCATION:Masconomet Regional\, Boxford
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 0\, Masconomet 7\nMasco
 nomet won 7–0 on its home field\, the same score as the first meeting in
  Danvers.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/socce
 r/schedule.html?team=boys
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=boys
