UID:cross-country-9@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Cross Country at Masconomet
LOCATION:Bradley Palmer State Park
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nBoys: lost 50–15\nGirls: lost 34–2
 5\nMasconomet swept the last dual meet of the regular season at Bradley Pa
 lmer State Park. The Chieftains' boys took the first five places for a per
 fect 15–50 score\, finishing 7–0 and clinching their first Northeaster
 n Conference title\, and the Masconomet girls won 25–34.\nSchedule and r
 esults: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/cross-country/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/cross-country/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
