SUMMARY:Danvers Football vs Salem (W 41–0)
LOCATION:Morse Field at Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 41\, Salem 0\nDanvers celebrated Sen
 ior Night with its third straight shutout. Jack Houston scored three touch
 downs\, one on a 32-yard run\, and captain Nick Xerras returned an interce
 ption 41 yards for another as the Falcons built a 14–0 lead in the first
  quarter and a 35–0 lead at halftime.\nSchedule and results: https://dan
 versfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
